{"panneau":"contact","panneauNom":"contact","passages":[{"id":37,"page":"contact.html","ancre":"contact-temoin","titre":"Nous joindre — déménagé, pas supprimé","panneau":"contact","texte":"✎ Nous joindre — déménagé, pas supprimé Pour écrire au site, un seul panneau : Écrire à SoPHIa. Celui-ci est la carte-témoin de l’ancien panneau « Nous joindre », gardée pour que l’ancienne adresse mène toujours quelque part. Carte-témoin. Ce panneau était « Nous joindre ». Depuis la version 41, écrire au site passe par un seul panneau — Écrire à SoPHIa — où son agente SoPHIa reçoit les messages et répond en son nom. L’ancien panneau reste ici en témoin du déménagement : rien n’a été supprimé en silence, et les anciennes adresses de cette feuille continuent d’arriver quelque part — ici, à un bouton de la porte unique.","mots":["nous","joindre","demenage","pas","supprime","pour","ecrire","au","site","un","seul","panneau","ecrire","a","sophia","celui-ci","est","la","carte-temoin","de","l","ancien","panneau","nous","joindre","gardee","pour","que","l","ancienne","adresse","mene","toujours","quelque","part","carte-temoin","ce","panneau","etait","nous","joindre","depuis","la","version","41","ecrire","au","site","passe","par","un","seul","panneau","ecrire","a","sophia","ou","son","agente","sophia","recoit","les","messages","et","repond","en","son","nom","l","ancien","panneau","reste","ici","en","temoin","du","demenagement","rien","n","a","ete","supprime","en","silence","et","les","anciennes","adresses","de","cette","feuille","continuent","d","arriver","quelque","part","ici","a","un","bouton","de","la","porte","unique"],"empreinte":"07f8bea178e5e4138755e2f5b6d7b6ba8691a174172541bb62a071d4f80321ee","merkle":{"feuille":37,"chemin":[{"cote":"gauche","digest":"5875bbddc02402a8ef7eab2751a562d99615a2ac532b9247a2a91c9624be78c5"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"f2654ded47d549bd28715650925d08f6c33fab5802160eba26135d41dc7e5d60"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"96dbeec9f6c50d2d56ab8abf23ec91369f8215de78439ca6